Installation:

If you download the tar ball, extract files by
$tar -xzvf coatli-1.0.5.tar.gz

and change directory
$cd coatli-1.0.5

Compile by
$make

And install (probably root permissions required) into /usr/local/bin by
$make install

In order to change the installation directory, edit the Makefile.

$make clean
removes the compiled files from the local directory.
